          <p class="text-xs text-center text-provifood-gray mt-1">y Grasas</p>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/categoria/pastas" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-orange-100 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-orange-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-center text-provifood-dark text-lg">Pastas</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-center text-provifood-gray mt-1">y Fideos</p>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/categoria/arroz" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-green-100 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-center text-provifood-dark text-lg">Arroz</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-center text-provifood-gray mt-1">y Legumbres</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Call to Action B2B -->
  <section class="bg-provifood-primary text-white py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-provifood-secondary px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-bold mb-6">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-white">Soluciones B2B</span>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-5 text-white">¿Necesitas un Presupuesto Personalizado?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/90 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Nuestro equipo comercial está listo para ayudarte a encontrar los mejores productos y precios para tu negocio
        </p>
        
        <!-- Beneficios B2B -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-provifood-secondary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Precios Mayoristas</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80">Descuentos especiales por volumen</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-provifood-secondary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Asesoría Personalizada</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80">Ejecutivo dedicado a tu cuenta</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/20">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-provifood-secondary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Entrega Programada</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80">Despachos según tus necesidades</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
